## 5. The flow of your app

```
App starts
    │
    ▼
AuthProvider loads
    │
    ├── Checks AsyncStorage for saved session cookie
    │       │
    │       ├── Cookie found → show Dashboard (AppTabs)
    │       │
    │       └── No cookie → show Login/Signup screens
    │
    ▼
User on Login screen
    │
    ├── Types userName + password
    ├── Presses "Sign in"
    ├── validate() runs → checks fields aren't empty
    ├── api.post('/auth/login', { userName, password })
    │       │
    │       ├── Backend validates → finds user → checks password
    │       ├── Creates Redis session → returns cookieValue
    │       │
    │       ▼
    ├── login(cookieValue) called
    │       ├── Saves cookieValue to AsyncStorage (permanent storage)
    │       └── Sets cookie in AuthContext state
    │
    ▼
cookie is now set → Root navigator switches to AppTabs automatically
```

