## 7. Navigation — how screens work

You have two navigators:

```
NavigationContainer (the wrapper)
    │
    ├── AuthStackNav (when NOT logged in)
    │       ├── Login screen
    │       └── Signup screen
    │
    └── AppTabs (when logged in — bottom tab bar)
            ├── Tasks screen
            ├── Analytics screen
            ├── Settings screen
            └── Profile screen
```

The switch between them is automatic:
```ts
// In Root component:
{cookie
  ? <AppTabs />        // has cookie = logged in
  : <AuthStackNav />   // no cookie = show login
}
```

When you call `login(cookieValue)`, `cookie` goes from `null` to a string, React detects the change, and the whole navigator switches instantly.

