## 10. AsyncStorage — the phone's hard drive

```ts
// Saves data permanently on the phone (survives app restarts)
await AsyncStorage.setItem('session_cookie', cookieValue);

// Reads it back
const saved = await AsyncStorage.getItem('session_cookie');

// Deletes it (on logout)
await AsyncStorage.removeItem('session_cookie');
```

This is why you stay logged in after closing and reopening the app. 
The cookie is saved on the phone. On startup, `AuthProvider` reads it and if it exists, 
skips the login screen.

