## 12. The theme system in your app

Your app supports dark/light mode automatically:

```ts
const scheme = useColorScheme(); // returns 'dark' or 'light'
const theme = scheme === 'dark' ? DARK : LIGHT;

// Then every color references the theme:
<Text style={{ color: theme.text }}>Hello</Text>
//                     ↑ white in dark mode, black in light mode
```

`LIGHT` and `DARK` are just plain objects with colour values. When the phone switches mode, `useColorScheme()` returns a new value, the component re-renders, and everything recolours.

